# AI agent / assistant configs — local only, not tracked.
# Trailing slash on .claude/ ensures only the directory is matched, not
# any file named ".claude" that might appear in a subdirectory.
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.cursor/
# copilot-instructions.md: intentionally ignored — pollux-go uses AGENTS.md
# as the canonical AI-agent instruction file (cross-tool compatible).
# Teams wanting GitHub Copilot support should un-comment this line and
# maintain the file via a separate tracked path if desired.
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.zcode/

